  surveying, QA and marketing already existed in the repo unused.
  Split into 6 accurate divisions (Security, Networks, Survey, Web,
  QA, Marketing), each with its own icon and correct service list.
- Updated footer Solutions list to match the 6 divisions, keeping
  it consistent with the services section and the contact form's
  existing 6-option service dropdown.
