From 04f7ca699ecc5bacd69fa0c778e9f349a480961c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 04:34:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add DPDP-compliant Privacy Policy, consent checkbox, and
 restore larger logo
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Added privacy-policy.html: covers data fiduciary identity, what's
  collected via the contact form, purpose/legal basis (consent),
  third-party sharing disclosure (Google Apps Script/Sheets used to
  store enquiries), retention, cookies, security, Data Principal
  rights, Grievance Officer contact, and right to complain to the
  Data Protection Board of India — per the DPDP Act 2023, DPDP Rules
  2025, and IT Act 2000 / SPDI Rules 2011.
- Added a required consent checkbox to the contact form, linking to
  the new Privacy Policy, with validation in script.js blocking
  submission until checked, and the consent flag now recorded with
  each submission as evidence of consent.
- Linked Privacy Policy from both footers.
- Restored the navbar/footer logo to a larger size (86px nav logo,
  96px header) per feedback — bigger than the previous fix but
  short of the earlier 172px/184px header that was overflowing the
  page.
---
